#Setup Monast on Debian OS with help of docker

  # Complete Monast Installation Guide with Docker CentOS 7

This guide will walk you through installing Monast (network monitoring tool) using Docker with CentOS 7, resolving all Python 2.7 dependencies.

## Prerequisites
- Docker installed on your host system
- Internet connection for downloading packages

