## Step 2: Pull and Run CentOS 7 Container

## Step 2: Pull and Run CentOS 7 Container

    # Pull CentOS 7 image
    docker pull centos:7

    # Run container with port mapping for web access and SSH
    docker run -d --name monast-server -p 8080:80 -p 2222:22 -v $(pwd):/app centos:7 tail -f /dev/null

    # Enter the container
    docker exec -it monast-server bash

**💡 Tip:** The `-v $(pwd):/app` mounts your current directory to `/app` in the container for easy file transfer.

