## Step 3: Fix CentOS 7 Repository Issues

**⚠️ Important:** CentOS 7 reached End of Life, so we need to fix the repositories first:

```bash
# Fix CentOS 7 repositories to use vault.centos.org
sed -i -e '/^mirrorlist/d;/^#baseurl=/{s,^#,,;s,/mirror,/vault,;}' /etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS*.repo

# Clear yum cache
yum clean all

# Update system
yum update -y

# Install development tools and Python 2.7
yum groupinstall -y "Development Tools"
yum install -y python python-devel gcc openssl-devel libffi-devel

# Install PHP and web server
yum install -y httpd php php-pear

# Install network and utility tools
yum install -y wget curl vim net-tools subversion unzip
```

**⚠️ Note:** CentOS 7 comes with Python 2.7 by default, which is perfect for Monast.

