## Step 5: Install Python Dependencies

### Install pip for Python 2.7:

    # Method 1: Try yum first
    sudo yum install -y python-pip

    # Method 2: If yum doesn't work, install manually
    curl https://bootstrap.pypa.io/pip/2.7/get-pip.py -o get-pip.py

    python get-pip.py

### Install Python packages:

    # Install Twisted Python framework
    pip install twisted

    # Install zope.interface
    pip install zope.interface

    # Verify installations
    python -c "import twisted; print twisted.__version__"

    python -c "import zope.interface; print zope.interface.__version__"

**💡 Tip:** If you get SSL errors, add `--trusted-host pypi.org --trusted-host files.pythonhosted.org` to pip commands.

