## Step 6: Install Starpy

### Download and install from SourceForge:

    cd /tmp

    # Download Starpy from SourceForge
    wget https://sourceforge.net/projects/starpy/files/latest/download -O starpy.tar.gz

    # Extract and install
    tar -xzf starpy.tar.gz

    cd starpy-*

    python setup.py install

    # Verify installation
    python -c "import starpy; print 'Starpy installed successfully'"

**⚠️ Alternative:** If SourceForge download fails:

    # Use SVN to get latest trunk
    svn export http://starpy.svn.sourceforge.net/svnroot/starpy/trunk starpy-trunk

    cd starpy-trunk

    python setup.py install

