## Step 8: Install Monast

### Download from GitHub:

    cd /var/www/html

    wget https://github.com/dagmoller/monast/archive/refs/heads/master.zip -O monast.zip

    unzip monast.zip

    mv monast-master monast

    # Set proper permissions
    chown -R apache:apache /var/www/html/monast

    chmod -R 755 /var/www/html/monast

**💡 Alternative:** Copy from `/tmp` if you downloaded it there:

    # If you have pear.zip in /tmp
    cd /tmp

    unzip pear.zip

    cp -r monast /var/www/html/

