## Step 9: Configure and Start Services

### Start Apache web server:

    # Start Apache
    /usr/sbin/httpd

    # Create a simple test page
    echo "<h1>Apache is running</h1>" > /var/www/html/index.html

    # Test web server
    curl localhost

### Configure Monast:

    cd /var/www/html/monast

    cp config/config.ini.sample config/config.ini

    # Edit configuration (optional)
    vim config/config.ini

