## Troubleshooting Tips

### 🔧 Common Issues:

**Python module not found:**
```bash
# Check Python path
python -c "import sys; print sys.path"

# Reinstall missing modules
pip install twisted zope.interface
```

**PEAR packages not found:**
```bash
# Check include path
php -r "echo get_include_path();"

# List installed packages
pear list

# Reinstall manually if needed (see Step 6)
```

**Port conflicts:**
```bash
# Check what's using ports
netstat -tulpn | grep -E ":80|:8080|:2222"

# Use different ports when running container
docker run -d --name monast-server -p 9080:80 -p 2223:22 centos:7
```

**Container networking issues:**
```bash
# Get container IP
docker inspect monast-server | grep IPAddress

# Access directly via container IP
curl http://172.17.0.2/monast/
```

### 📝 Useful Commands:

```bash
# Check container status
docker ps -a

# View container logs
docker logs monast-server

# Stop/start container
docker stop monast-server
docker start monast-server

# Save container state
docker commit monast-server monast-configured

# Remove container
docker rm monast-server
```

